      "description": "kW from 15-min kWh slots. The PromQL original was avg_over_time(...[$__interval:15m]) * 4; the SQL equivalent must average per 15-min slot FIRST and only then scale by 4. sum(value) * 4 over a bucket wider than 15 min would be wrong (a 1h bucket of 4x1 kWh gives 16, not 4 kW). The inner SAMPLE BY 15m is what pins the slot width regardless of the outer bucket.",
